        "displayLine1": "BEFORE THE",
        "displayLine2": "FIRST WORD",
        "displayLine3": "EVER COMES",
        "body": "The best writing rarely begins at the keyboard. It starts in stillness. These five quiet rituals create the conditions where exceptional work can emerge.",
        "handle": "@thedraft",
        "slideId": "Slide 02"
      }
    },
    {
      "layoutId": "body-noir-yellow",
      "slots": {
        "brand": "THE DRAFT",
        "scriptPrefix": "Try",
        "displayLine1": "EMPTY THE",
        "displayLine2": "MIND FIRST",
        "displayLine3": "EVERY MORNING",
        "body": "Write three pages of stream-of-consciousness before sunrise. Do not edit. This clears the mental debris and makes room for clarity.",
        "handle": "@thedraft",
        "slideId": "Slide 03"
      }
    },
    {
      "layoutId": "body-noir-yellow",
      "slots": {
        "brand": "THE DRAFT",
        "scriptPrefix": "Focus",
        "displayLine1": "WALK IN",
        "displayLine2": "SILENCE BEFORE",
        "displayLine3": "YOU WRITE",
        "body": "A twenty-minute walk without headphones untangles narrative knots. Movement quiets the editor in your head so the creator can speak.",
        "handle": "@thedraft",
        "slideId": "Slide 04"
      }
    },
    {
      "layoutId": "body-noir-yellow",
      "slots": {
        "brand": "THE DRAFT",
        "scriptPrefix": "Begin",
        "displayLine1": "SAME TIME",
        "displayLine2": "SAME PLACE",
        "displayLine3": "SAME SIGNAL",
        "body": "Ritual is an anchor. When you return to the same chair at the same hour, your brain shifts into writing mode automatically.",
        "handle": "@thedraft",
        "slideId": "Slide 05"
      }
    },
    {
      "layoutId": "body-noir-yellow",
      "slots": {
        "brand": "THE DRAFT",
        "scriptPrefix": "Try",
        "displayLine1": "READ ONE",
        "displayLine2": "PAGE OF",
        "displayLine3": "GREAT PROSE",
        "body": "Read a paragraph of masterful writing before you begin. It tunes your ear to rhythm and reminds you what language is capable of.",
        "handle": "@thedraft",
        "slideId": "Slide 06"
      }
    },
    {
      "layoutId": "body-noir-yellow",
      "slots": {
        "brand": "THE DRAFT",
        "scriptPrefix": "Focus",
        "displayLine1": "STOP WHEN",
        "displayLine2": "YOU KNOW",
        "displayLine3": "WHAT COMES NEXT",
        "body": "Hemingway left the last sentence unfinished. It guarantees you return with momentum instead of staring at a blank page the next morning.",
        "handle": "@thedraft",
        "slideId": "Slide 07"
      }
    }
